&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;About Emplifi &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://emplifi.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Emplifi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is the only&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://emplifi.io/platform-overview/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Autonomous CX platform&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; unifying social marketing, commerce, and customer care for more than 20,000 brands worldwide. Powered by Fuel AI, built on more than 5T of data, and recognized as a leader by leading industry analysts, Emplifi helps enterprise teams orchestrate connected customer journeys and deliver personalized experiences at scale, turning every customer touchpoint into a competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Sales Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Emplifi’s sales team is spread around the globe and helps businesses to scale their digital CX innovations and operations internationally while supporting clients of all sizes. Brand relationships are key to our business but we also work with hundreds of agency and media partners. Our aim is always the same - empower marketers to achieve more, no matter where they are or what industry they’re in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of an international team, you will have the opportunity to work with colleagues from Sydney all the way to Sao Paulo, from New York to Singapore and be part of an ever-growing family. You will be supported in your career by a team of professionals dedicated to your development, so that you can grow as a professional and a social media expert advisor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Executive (“AE”) is a pivotal role within Emplifi’s social sales team. This individual carries an individual quota target and is responsible for driving new business, nurturing existing client relationships, and exploring opportunities for cross-selling and upselling. The Account Executive will have a specific focus on either a geographically-based territory or named account territory, ensuring consistent growth and maximization of revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do Here&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and identify new business opportunities within the designated territory or named accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a robust pipeline of potential clients through networking, research, and referrals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present our digital marketing solutions to potential clients, demonstrating how our services can help meet their business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with the Solution Consultant and the Customer Success Manager, the AE will foster and grow relationships with existing clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand clients&#39; business goals, challenges, and needs to identify opportunities for additional products and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly review client campaigns and provide insights, optimization suggestions, and reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-selling and Upselling:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognize opportunities to offer additional or premium services to current clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the customer success organization and solution consultant to identify the next best solutions for existing clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a comprehensive sales strategy for the assigned territory or named accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize CRM tools to track interactions, sales progress, and client information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular feedback to the marketing and product teams about market trends, competition, and customer feedback to inform our offerings and strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with internal teams such as marketing, product, and customer support to ensure client expectations are met and exceeded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend regular sales meetings to update the team on achievements and challenges and to collaborate on strategies and tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the Business Development team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, research, and engage potential leads through various channels including social media, industry events, and outbound strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify leads by assessing their potential needs and fit for our digital marketing solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently manage and update the sales pipeline using CRM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast potential sales activities and revenue outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and prioritize leads to ensure efficient time and resource allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Marketing, Communications, or a related field strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of sales experience, preferably in the digital marketing industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of meeting and exceeding sales quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of digital marketing services including e-commerce, social media, content marketing etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first mindset, with the ability to continuously leverage AI tools to simplify processes, streamline workflows, boost efficiency, and drive measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English is essential, together with fluency in at least one additional European language (French, Spanish or Italian)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in using CRM tools like Salesforce or HubSpot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chance to work with the world’s biggest brands at the CX tech leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile and open-minded culture, with high levels of trust and flexibility&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for professional growth and development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibility to learn new and cutting-edge technologies, in an environment that encourages new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-first workplace, with access to leading AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and more), empowering you to work smarter, innovate faster, and build AI skills for the future&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sick Days &amp;amp; Community Service Days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meetups &amp;amp; conferences&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefits package including Private Health Insurance and Pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family/parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office in the heart of Central London&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There’s more as well! Speak with us to find out all the details!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Emplifi, we are committed to creating a workplace where everyone is valued, respected, and empowered to bring their whole selves to work. We welcome applications from individuals of all ages, races, religions, genders, sexual orientations, gender identities, and LGBTQ+ communities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Emplifi offers a safe, inclusive, and supportive environment where every employee has the opportunity to thrive and is encouraged to be who they are.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome and encourage applicants with disabilities. Accommodations are available upon request at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;About Emplifi &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://emplifi.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Emplifi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is the only&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://emplifi.io/platform-overview/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Autonomous CX platform&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; unifying social marketing, commerce, and customer care for more than 20,000 brands worldwide. Powered by Fuel AI, built on more than 5T of data, and recognized as a leader by leading industry analysts, Emplifi helps enterprise teams orchestrate connected customer journeys and deliver personalized experiences at scale, turning every customer touchpoint into a competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re not running an AI pilot. We&#39;re not building a chatbot. We&#39;re systematically rebuilding repeatable workflows across Sales, Marketing, Finance, Customer Success, HR, Legal, and Operations on an AI-native foundation. We call this initiative &lt;strong&gt;AI Pioneer&lt;/strong&gt;, and it is the defining internal transformation program at Emplifi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Agentic Builder is at the heart of that transformation. Embedded directly within business teams, you&#39;ll rapidly turn business problems into working AI solutions by building agents, workflows, automations, and integrations that deliver measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll operate within a federated model: a small central AI team provides shared infrastructure, governance, and engineering standards, while you own solution discovery, delivery, and adoption within your business function. You&#39;ll partner closely with AI Engineers to scale successful solutions into production when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a consulting role. You don&#39;t recommend and move on—you build, you ship, and you own, whether it works.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do Here&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discover &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed within business teams to map existing workflows, identify automation opportunities, and prioritise by impact and feasibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business goals into concrete agentic workflow specifications — defining inputs, outputs, decision logic, and human-in-the-loop touchpoints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Deploy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship end-to-end AI solutions using the fastest appropriate approach — combining code-first development (Python, JavaScript), agent frameworks, APIs, and low-code/no-code platforms (n8n, Make, Zapier, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build agents, automations, and workflow systems that solve specific business problems and can be rapidly tested, improved, and scaled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineer prompts as production assets — versioned, evaluated, regression-tested. Not vibes. Reusable prompt chains over one-shot cleverness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build integrations between AI solutions and existing business systems using APIs and modern integration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI coding assistants to accelerate development while maintaining ownership of code quality, reliability, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed &amp;amp; Enable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the in-team AI expert for your assigned function — training colleagues, documenting workflows, and building institutional knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with AI Engineers and the AI Pioneer Governance team to review, harden, and transition solutions requiring production infrastructure, security review, or advanced engineering support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Iterate &amp;amp; Scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve shipped workflows based on usage feedback; establish monitoring, fallback logic, and human escalation paths&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface reusable patterns and components across functions, and contribute to the organisation&#39;s agentic playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognize this is an emerging role, and titles vary widely across the industry. We&#39;re more interested in evidence of building than a specific career path. Show us what you&#39;ve shipped — automations, agents, integrations, AI-powered workflows, or other solutions that delivered real business value.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; AI Engineering Foundations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production-grade prompt engineering: systematic, versioned, regression-tested, and eval-gated before release — not just demo-proven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writes and maintains Python and/or JavaScript at a production level, with strong leverage of AI coding assistants; fluent across code-first and low-code environments, and knows when each is the right call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of agentic systems and workflow orchestration: autonomous agents, deterministic workflows, API calls, and human-in-the-loop decision points — knows when to use which&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong integration skills: API docs, OAuth, webhooks, JSON parsing, retry logic, rate limits, and connecting AI to existing business systems and data sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp of LLM fundamentals — context windows, temperature, tool use, structured outputs, RAG, model cost, and latency tradeoffs — and applies them to make sound decisions on model selection, output quality, and workflow design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moves fast from proof of concept to production through rapid iteration, user feedback, and a clear-eyed understanding of how data structure and output formatting affect downstream reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; Systems Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks in end-to-end workflows rather than isolated tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable designing for failure: edge cases, fallback paths, and human escalation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can scope what should and shouldn&#39;t be automated&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly translates ambiguous business problems into buildable technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands how business functions operate and designs for real-world processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates technical concepts clearly to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Security&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognizes security, privacy, and compliance risks in AI workflows and knows when to involve central governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands core AI security concepts, including prompt injection, permissions, and secure handling of secrets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ships working solutions with a bias toward action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns outcomes, measuring whether solutions deliver business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds trust through curiosity, execution, and results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating as a change agent in teams that may be skeptical — wins people over through results, not persuasion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knows when to involve AI Engineering and how to hand off effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sick Days &amp;amp; Community Service Days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multisport card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity and Parental Benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chance to work with the world&#39;s biggest brands at the CX tech leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile and open-minded culture, with high levels of trust and flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for professional growth and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibility to learn new and cutting-edge technologies, in an environment that encourages new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-first workplace, with access to leading AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and more), empowering you to work smarter, innovate faster, and build AI skills for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal tech talks, Udemy courses, and workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meetups &amp;amp; conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibility to work from offices in Prague (Karlin), Brno (Impact Hub), Pilsen (Roudná), or remotely within the Czech Republic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There&#39;s more as well! Speak with us to find out all the details!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Emplifi, we are committed to creating a workplace where everyone is valued, respected, and empowered to bring their whole selves to work. We welcome applications from individuals of all ages, races, religions, genders, sexual orientations, gender identities, and LGBTQ+ communities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Emplifi offers a safe, inclusive, and supportive environment where every employee has the opportunity to thrive and is encouraged to be who they are.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome and encourage applicants with disabilities. Accommodations are available upon request at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;About Emplifi &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://emplifi.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Emplifi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is the only&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://emplifi.io/platform-overview/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Autonomous CX platform&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; unifying social marketing, commerce, and customer care for more than 20,000 brands worldwide. Powered by Fuel AI, built on more than 5T of data, and recognized as a leader by leading industry analysts, Emplifi helps enterprise teams orchestrate connected customer journeys and deliver personalized experiences at scale, turning every customer touchpoint into a competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Marketing Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Marketing is the centre of creativity at Emplifi. We are a growing department with an attitude of if you can dream it, you can market it. The marketing team drives powerful initiatives that impact how we are seen by the rest of the world, and ultimately engages prospects and customers on a journey with us. Every role on our team holds a key function in the success of our business. You&#39;ll work alongside skilled marketing experts located across the globe, in addition to collaborating cross-functionally with other teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One thing we can promise is you&#39;ll never get bored. Being in a hyper-growth stage we have so many exciting adventures ahead of us. If you&#39;re looking for a job where you can have a real impact then you&#39;ve come to the right place.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a strategic and execution-focused Customer Marketing Manager to drive retention, expansion, and advocacy across Emplifi’s customer base.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this role will focus on turning satisfied customers into long-term partners and active advocates. You will own programs that increase customer engagement, drive cross-sell and upsell opportunities, and build a strong pipeline of customer proof to support growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will play a critical role in ensuring Emplifi delivers value beyond the product—creating meaningful customer experiences that strengthen relationships and drive measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role can be based in our European Offices in London, Munich or Prague.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do Here&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with leadership across Marketing, Customer Success, Sales, and Product to drive customer engagement, retention, and expansion across Emplifi’s customer base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Marketing to develop and execute programs that ensure customers are realizing value from the platform, increasing adoption and long-term retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive campaigns and initiatives that support cross-sell and upsell opportunities, partnering with Sales and Customer Success to identify and activate expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive reuse of demand generation campaigns and assets for customer audiences, tailoring messaging to support retention and expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale Emplifi’s customer advocacy program, including case studies, testimonials, reviews, and reference management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, engage, and nurture customer champions, turning satisfied customers into active advocates and contributors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive creative and engaging customer marketing activities across regions, balancing global consistency with local relevance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, plan, and manage customer engagement programs, including webinars, roundtables, and virtual and in-person events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and run customer advisory boards in partnership with Product and Customer Success to ensure customer feedback informs product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the strategy and execution of customer-focused events, including Emplifi’s user conference and regional activations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and engage third-party experts, partners, and customers to strengthen credibility and deepen relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage program execution end-to-end, including logistics, vendors, and budgets, ensuring high-quality delivery across all initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Bring to Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in customer marketing, lifecycle marketing, or related marketing roles in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and execute marketing campaigns to drive customer engagement, retention, and expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first mindset, with the ability to continuously leverage AI tools to simplify processes, streamline workflows, boost efficiency, and drive measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with Sales, Customer Success, and Product Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing multiple programs and stakeholders across regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with tools such as Salesforce, Marketo, and customer marketing platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing events, campaigns, and customer programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset with the ability to measure and communicate impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-energy, proactive, and execution-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chance to work with the world’s biggest brands at the CX tech leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile and open-minded culture, with high levels of trust and flexibility&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for professional growth and development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibility to learn new and cutting-edge technologies, in an environment that encourages new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-first workplace, with access to leading AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and more), empowering you to work smarter, innovate faster, and build AI skills for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to use English on a daily basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There’s more as well! Speak with us to find out all the details!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Emplifi, we are committed to creating a workplace where everyone is valued, respected, and empowered to bring their whole selves to work. We welcome applications from individuals of all ages, races, religions, genders, sexual orientations, gender identities, and LGBTQ+ communities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
